Upstream-Name: Lunduke City
Source: https://github.com/BryanLunduke/LundukeCity

Lunduke City is a city-building game. Its simulation engine is the
Micropolis engine (GPL-3.0-or-later) with the additional terms below.
The gtkmm user interface is original to Lunduke City and is also
GPL-3.0-or-later. The complete GNU GPL version 3 is in the file COPYING.

This tree does not include the upstream Tcl/Tk interface, Python/SWIG
bindings, DejaVu fonts, or scenario files. Map tiles, sprites, the
hexa tile resources, and sounds are vendored separately (see below).
The additional terms apply to the engine sources, to those assets, and
to the combined program.

In this copyright file the last matching Files paragraph wins, so the
specific vendored paths are listed after the general paragraph.

