Comment:
 Vendored from https://github.com/SimHacker/micropolis
 commit c98f6b08519887b450d9be198bfca5237aab6d0c
 path MicropolisCore/src/MicropolisEngine/src
 (upstream commit date 2026-02-10), then modified by Lunduke City.
 This is a modified version of that engine and is not the original
 program (GNU GPL version 3, section 7, and the additional terms
 below). The Lunduke City changes are:
 voteProblems() wraps the problem index with >= PROBNUM, so a yearly
 evaluation does not read past problemTable or write problemOrder[0];
 destroy() frees sprites on the active list and the free list as well
 as the map arrays;
 setValves() clamps the industrial ratio into indRatio (the residential
 ratio computed above it is left alone);
 sendMessage() calls doMakeSound() before the front-end callback so
 disaster messages play their sounds.
 Tcl/Tk is not part of this import.
 See third_party/micropolis/README.md.

