 MicropolisCore/src/images/micropolisEngine/obj*.png,
 MicropolisCore/src/res/hexa.*, and
 MicropolisCore/src/res/sounds/*.wav.
 tiles.png is the classic 16-pixel map atlas. The obj images are the
 sprite frames for trains, ships, aircraft, tornadoes, the monster,
 and the other mobile entities. The hexa files are the original tile
 resources. The wav files are the sound effects.
 These bytes are not modified. See third_party/micropolis-assets/README.md.

